  "manufacturer": "Analog Devices (Maxim Integrated)",
  "part_number": "MAX30102EFD+T",
  "description": "Analog Devices (Maxim) MAX30102 integrated pulse-oximetry and heart-rate optical module in a 14-pin OESIP, 5.6 x 3.3 x 1.55 mm with integrated cover glass: red (660 nm) and IR (880 nm) LEDs, photodetector, ambient light cancellation, 18-bit ADC at 50-3200 sps, 32-sample FIFO, die temperature sensor. VDD 1.7-2.0 V, VLED+ 3.1-5.0 V, I2C target at fixed address 0x57 (400 kHz), active-low open-drain interrupt, 0.7 uA shutdown.",
