            "source": [
              "https://xonstorage.z8.web.core.windows.net/pdf/maxim_max30102efdt_apr22_xonlink.pdf (19-7740 Rev 0 p.32, outline 21-1048 rev B, D, E, A, b, L, e, D1, E1)",
