          "type": "usage_note",
          "params": {
            "note": "Photodetector aperture (the pin 1/14 end is labelled SENSOR). Photodiode 600-900 nm, radiant sensitive area 1.36 mm² (1.38 x 0.98 mm). Window 1.97 x 2.75 (REF), centred 0.822 mm from the body centre towards pins 1/14 mm in the top face (cover glass). Face it towards the skin through a clear enclosure window, with an opaque barrier between the two apertures to stop LED-to-photodiode crosstalk.",
            "source": [
              "https://xonstorage.z8.web.core.windows.net/pdf/maxim_max30102efdt_apr22_xonlink.pdf (19-7740 Rev 0 p.32, outline 21-1048 rev B, top view)",
